   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Location",
     "texto": [
      "To say «in front of» we use **przed**, and for «behind», **za**.",
      "For a fixed location, both prepositions take the instrumental: **przed łóżkiem**, **za łóżkiem**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Between and next to",
     "texto": [
      "**Między** («between») also takes the instrumental: **między łóżkiem a biurkiem**.",
      "**Obok** («next to») takes the genitive: **obok łóżka**. In English the noun doesn't change like that."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
